flowchart TD
    U["User Question + Identity"]
    SEC["Security & Policy\nACL · DB role · RLS"]
    G["Context & Evidence Grounding\nSchema · Values · Glossary · History"]
    GEN["Reasoning / SQL Generation\ngpt-oss-120b"]
    VER["Verification\nDeterministic + optional independent verifier"]
    DB["Controlled DB Interaction\nDry-run · EXPLAIN · Probe · Safe Execute"]
    RISK{{"Decision & Risk\nEnough evidence?"}}
    ORCH["Adaptive Orchestrator\nBounded loops"]
    A["ANSWER"]
    M["AMBIGUOUS"]
    X["ABSTAIN"]
    U --> SEC --> G --> GEN --> VER --> DB --> RISK
    RISK -->|strong evidence| A
    RISK -->|specific ambiguity| M
    RISK -->|cannot resolve| X
    RISK -->|resolvable uncertainty| ORCH
    ORCH -->|context| G
    ORCH -->|alternative solution| GEN
    ORCH -->|deeper check| VER
    ORCH -->|DB evidence| DB